    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12361" root="درأ" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِدْرَأٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing with which one pushes,</i> or <i>thrusts;</i>
or <i>pushes,</i> or <i>thrusts, away,</i> or <i>back.</i> (TA.)
[Applied in the present day, pronounced <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِدْرَا</span>,
without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>, to <i>A boat-pole.</i>]

